00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:14,000
Let's take the one at the back.

590
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:15,280
What do you think?

591
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:22,080
Actually, I want to sit with Sha Yue'er.

592
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:24,760
Then...

593
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:27,080
I'll sit with Liang Xiaoyu.

594
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:29,040
Then I'll keep Chen Hewen company.

595
00:24:31,320 --> 00:24:32,360
Thank you. You're amazing.

596
00:24:32,360 --> 00:24:33,240
Okay, then I'll go with her.

597
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:33,720
Sure.

598
00:24:33,720 --> 00:24:34,000
Okay.

599
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:34,480
Thank you.

600
00:24:34,480 --> 00:24:35,240
No problem.

601
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:35,960
You're amazing.

602
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:36,960
There's another car, right?

603
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:37,840
Yours is over there?

604
00:24:37,840 --> 00:24:38,520
Yeah.

605
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:42,360
Let's go.

606
00:24:45,840 --> 00:24:47,760
Please, princess, get in the car.

607
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:49,640
Let's go.

608
00:24:49,640 --> 00:24:50,840
Someone's sitting here.

609
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:52,680
Someone's sitting here.

610
00:24:52,680 --> 00:24:54,320
Sorry.

611
00:24:54,320 --> 00:24:54,760
It's okay.

612
00:24:55,520 --> 00:24:56,480
Should we go back?

613
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:57,360
How did this happen?

614
00:24:58,120 --> 00:24:59,080
Sorry.

615
00:25:00,640 --> 00:25:01,040
Hi.

616
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:02,120
Hi.

617
00:25:02,120 --> 00:25:03,120
That car is taken.

618
00:25:03,120 --> 00:25:04,600
Move over there.

619
00:25:07,320 --> 00:25:08,880
How about Chen Hewen in the front?

620
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:11,240
Sure.

621
00:25:11,800 --> 00:25:13,200
Okay, I'm fine anywhere.

622
00:25:24,980 --> 00:25:26,220
(Little bug)

623
00:25:42,800 --> 00:25:43,600
Today my hair

624
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:45,080
isn't styled

625
00:25:45,080 --> 00:25:46,560
with every single strand defined.

626
00:25:47,600 --> 00:25:49,000
But it still looks good.

627
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,380
(Touching)
Looks good.

628
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,280
Really good.

629
00:25:53,520 --> 00:25:54,760
I didn't use much spray today either.

630
00:25:54,760 --> 00:25:56,360
Yeah, but I did spray a little.

631
00:25:56,740 --> 00:25:58,000
(Touch)

632
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,400
Seems like there's
less than yesterday too.

633
00:26:04,460 --> 00:26:06,580
(Holding hands)

634
00:26:07,180 --> 00:26:07,870
Oh my gosh.

635
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:16,800
She's proactive. So cute.

636
00:26:17,360 --> 00:26:17,800
Cui Kaiyi's like,

637
00:26:17,800 --> 00:26:19,560
what's wrong with me
touching my boyfriend's hand?

638
00:26:20,880 --> 00:26:21,960
We're leaving.

639
00:26:21,960 --> 00:26:22,760
Let's go!

640
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:28,720
Now I finally feel like I'm in Thailand.

641
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:29,800
Look at that.

642
00:26:29,800 --> 00:26:31,400
You know "mai mee tang ka".
[*Mai mee tang ka: I have no money]

643
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:32,160
I know it now too.

644
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:33,640
Mai mee tang ka
[*Mai mee tang ka: I have no money]

645
00:26:33,640 --> 00:26:34,320
Sawasdee ka.
[*Sawasdee ka: Hello]

646
00:26:34,320 --> 00:26:35,160
Ka bong ka.
[*Ka bong ka: Hello to you too]

647
00:26:36,760 --> 00:26:38,440
Sawasdee ka.
[*Sawasdee ka: Hello]

648
00:26:38,740 --> 00:26:39,840
So beautiful.

649
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:45,080
So beautiful.

650
00:26:45,080 --> 00:26:46,640
What color does
the sea look in the daytime?

651
00:26:46,920 --> 00:26:47,800
Green.

652
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:48,760
Yeah.

653
00:26:52,040 --> 00:26:53,120
You lost.

654
00:26:53,120 --> 00:26:53,920
You guessed it so accurately.

655
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:55,480
What was the punishment again?

656
00:26:55,750 --> 00:26:57,400
Carry you or hug you?

657
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:00,680
Don't carry me.

658
00:27:00,840 --> 00:27:01,440
Hug you?

659
00:27:01,440 --> 00:27:02,680
Spin around ten times.

660
00:27:02,680 --> 00:27:03,440
Ten times?

661
00:27:03,760 --> 00:27:04,080
Okay.

662
00:27:04,080 --> 00:27:05,560
You said three extra squats yourself.

663
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:07,720
Okay.

664
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:12,240
She's really taking
the initiative, right?

665
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:15,000
Coconut trees.

666
00:27:15,960 --> 00:27:17,520
Can they fall down by themselves?

667
00:27:17,520 --> 00:27:18,360
They can fall.

668
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:21,800
Look at these two sitting.

669
00:27:21,800 --> 00:27:22,680
They're so close together.

670
00:27:23,560 --> 00:27:24,960
Yu Yang!

671
00:27:25,560 --> 00:27:26,400
Is it crowded?

672
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:27,600
The middle seat

673
00:27:27,600 --> 00:27:28,400
isn't even usable anymore.

674
00:27:28,400 --> 00:27:29,680
There's space beside you!

675
00:27:29,680 --> 00:27:30,800
They're almost stacked together.

676
00:27:30,800 --> 00:27:31,400
My eyesight is bad.

677
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:32,160
Is that one person or two?

678
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:34,120
They're basically folded into one person.

679
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:35,800
Blow a kiss.

680
00:27:38,440 --> 00:27:39,480
Who was that for?

681
00:27:49,940 --> 00:27:52,060
(Flipping)

682
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:54,360
Touching here, fiddling there.

683
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:01,600
(Blocking sunlight)
Look here.

684
00:28:07,840 --> 00:28:09,120
Did everyone brake suddenly?

685
00:28:10,040 --> 00:28:10,760
Are you okay?

686
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:12,440
No, it just happened so suddenly.

687
00:28:18,700 --> 00:28:20,060
(Poking)

688
00:28:20,080 --> 00:28:20,760
You...

689
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:21,680
You...

690
00:28:21,680 --> 00:28:22,400
you're laughing at me.

691
00:28:26,040 --> 00:28:26,960
No.

692
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:29,360
I've never laughed at you.

693
00:28:33,640 --> 00:28:35,360
What are those little hands doing?

694
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:38,520
I'm not laughing at you.

695
00:28:38,520 --> 00:28:39,200
I think you're cute.

696
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:39,880
That's why.

697
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:40,960
You're such a tiny girl,

698
00:28:40,960 --> 00:28:42,800
but you're actually tall.

699
00:28:42,800 --> 00:28:43,840
I think she's cute too.

700
00:28:43,840 --> 00:28:44,960
Very what?

701
00:28:45,440 --> 00:28:46,320
Very what?

702
00:28:46,680 --> 00:28:47,600
Very tall.

703
00:28:48,320 --> 00:28:49,920
But still such a little girl.

704
00:28:52,600 --> 00:28:54,000
Stop talking. Skip it.

705
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:55,080
That came out of nowhere.

706
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:06,120
My lips are a little dry.

707
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:08,960
Let me see if I brought lip balm.

708
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:10,560
You can use some lip gloss.

709
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:13,440
There's not much left in this.

710
00:29:15,280 --> 00:29:16,160
Not much left.

711
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:21,040
I feel like when people fall in love,

712
00:29:21,040 --> 00:29:22,760
they become very possessive

713
00:29:22,760 --> 00:29:24,320
about the other person's body.

714
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:26,480
This part can't be like this.

715
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:27,480
It's mine now.

716
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:28,800
This is my territory too.

717
00:29:28,800 --> 00:29:30,040
Those are my lips too.

718
00:29:30,040 --> 00:29:31,240
They're so dry.

719
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:33,080
Those are my lips too.

720
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:45,800
So that's what it tastes like.

721
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:54,000
No, I mean...

722
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:56,160
Yours too.

723
00:29:59,120 --> 00:30:00,320
Every single day...

724
00:30:02,960 --> 00:30:03,920
Are we there?

725
00:30:03,920 --> 00:30:05,080
Feels like we're almost there.

726
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:07,640
We're getting off.

727
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:09,480
The sun comes out as soon as you get off.

728
00:30:09,480 --> 00:30:11,200
It's so sunny!

729
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:11,940
I'll do it.

730
00:30:11,940 --> 00:30:13,240
(Helping carry the bag)

731
00:30:13,240 --> 00:30:14,360
I'll carry the water bottle.

732
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:18,760
I'm already getting excited.

733
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:21,600
My dream came true again.

734
00:30:21,600 --> 00:30:22,480
A cruise ship.

735
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:23,680
I'm so happy.

736
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:24,760
The sea is so blue.

737
00:30:24,760 --> 00:30:26,120
Careful.

738
00:30:26,120 --> 00:30:26,800
I'll serve you from the front.

739
00:30:26,800 --> 00:30:27,960
Okay.

740
00:30:29,280 --> 00:30:30,120
Where should we sit?

741
00:30:30,120 --> 00:30:31,680
I want to sit here.

742
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:34,160
Coming.

743
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:38,120
It's hard to hug you like this.

744
00:30:39,040 --> 00:30:39,920
We can.

745
00:30:41,980 --> 00:30:44,100
(Getting close)

746
00:30:46,840 --> 00:30:47,880
Where are you sitting?

747
00:30:47,880 --> 00:30:48,960
Right here.

748
00:30:49,320 --> 00:30:50,560
Here? Okay.

749
00:30:50,560 --> 00:30:51,780
I'll hand out the medicine.

750
00:30:51,780 --> 00:30:52,860
(Brought seasickness medicine)
For anyone who gets seasick.

751
00:30:52,860 --> 00:30:54,160
One person gets...

752
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:55,280
half a pill.

753
00:30:56,120 --> 00:30:57,360
Thanks, Mr. Chen.

754
00:30:57,360 --> 00:30:59,600
Don't get used to calling me that later.

755
00:30:59,600 --> 00:31:00,400
It's funny.

756
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:03,320
Give this to them first, Liang Renfang.

757
00:31:03,320 --> 00:31:03,800
Thanks.

758
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:04,200
Half a pill each.

759
00:31:04,200 --> 00:31:05,080
Here.

760
00:31:05,080 --> 00:31:06,160
This is for Cui Kaiyi and the others.

761
00:31:07,040 --> 00:31:08,440
Cui Kaiyi, seasickness medicine.

762
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,400
I'm okay. I'll keep it.

763
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:10,200
I don't get seasick.

764
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:11,520
This is for Cui Yihang and Si.

765
00:31:11,520 --> 00:31:11,970
Thanks.

766
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:13,720
I feel a little dizzy already.

767
00:31:14,440 --> 00:31:15,440
(Handing medicine)
Take half.

768
00:31:15,440 --> 00:31:16,540
Thanks.

769
00:31:16,540 --> 00:31:17,540
(Taking)

770
00:31:18,040 --> 00:31:19,280
Thanks.

771
00:31:20,600 --> 00:31:21,600
The boat's leaving.

772
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:22,840
It's moving.

773
00:31:22,840 --> 00:31:24,160
Yeah, it's turning.

774
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:27,640
We're heading out.

775
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:28,600
Let's go.

776
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:30,960
This feels amazing.

777
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:35,080
Okay, we're on the boat.

778
00:31:35,080 --> 00:31:37,280
The back.

779
00:31:40,520 --> 00:31:43,220
Hello, you can take off your life jackets.

780
00:31:43,220 --> 00:31:44,220
(The boat is stable
and everyone can move freely)

781
00:31:44,220 --> 00:31:45,640
We can remove our life jackets now?

782
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:47,320
Thanks.

783
00:31:47,320 --> 00:31:48,280
Come, let's take a photo.

784
00:31:48,800 --> 00:31:52,120
Three, two, one.

785
00:31:52,120 --> 00:31:53,160
I'm still so dark.

786
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:54,320
Make Mr. Chen super fair.

787
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:55,800
Okay, done.

788
00:31:58,520 --> 00:32:00,080
You're really good at taking photos.

789
00:32:00,080 --> 00:32:01,160
So beautiful.

790
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,760
Look, it looks like a heart.

791
00:32:02,760 --> 00:32:03,840
Really, take a photo quickly.

792
00:32:03,840 --> 00:32:04,600
I told you I have an eye

793
00:32:04,600 --> 00:32:06,440
for finding beautiful views.

794
00:32:06,440 --> 00:32:07,920
You're amazing.

795
00:32:08,360 --> 00:32:09,520
How do these glasses have a filter?

796
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:12,280
Look at the clouds.
They look more three-dimensional.

797
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,160
Will they look pink?

798
00:32:14,160 --> 00:32:15,520
Yeah, a little pink.

799
00:32:17,040 --> 00:32:18,920
The view looks better with glasses on.

800
00:32:18,920 --> 00:32:20,760
Put both hands around my waist.

801
00:32:20,760 --> 00:32:21,600
Rose.

802
00:32:24,600 --> 00:32:26,120
Fang looks so beautiful.

803
00:32:26,120 --> 00:32:27,320
Titanic!

804
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:29,000
Rose!

805
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:38,120
Sorry to interrupt you two.

806
00:32:50,220 --> 00:32:51,820
(Getting close)

807
00:32:56,740 --> 00:32:58,180
(Glances)

808
00:33:01,880 --> 00:33:03,160
Look at those two!

809
00:33:05,680 --> 00:33:06,960
The way they're looking at each other...

810
00:33:10,680 --> 00:33:12,640
This is hilarious!

811
00:33:13,120 --> 00:33:14,040
So funny.

812
00:33:20,180 --> 00:33:21,020
Oh my God.

813
00:33:21,560 --> 00:33:23,000
It's shaking so much.

814
00:33:24,280 --> 00:33:25,120
What's wrong, Sha Yue'er?

815
00:33:25,120 --> 00:33:26,000
(Concerned)
I'm dizzy.

816
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:26,760
You're seasick?

817
00:33:26,760 --> 00:33:27,400
Yeah.

818
00:33:30,860 --> 00:33:31,520
The medicine isn't working?

819
00:33:31,520 --> 00:33:32,320
Maybe take another half.

820
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,800
Maybe take another half.

821
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:35,920
I'll wait it out.

822
00:33:35,920 --> 00:33:37,600
It's shaking a lot upstairs.

823
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:39,720
I'll take you downstairs for some medicine.

824
00:33:40,120 --> 00:33:42,680
It's okay. I'll sit downstairs for a bit.

825
00:33:42,960 --> 00:33:43,960
It's usually shakier upstairs.

826
00:33:43,960 --> 00:33:44,760
Then let's go. This way.

827
00:33:44,760 --> 00:33:45,360
Okay.

828
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:49,120
Slowly.

829
00:33:49,120 --> 00:33:49,920
Okay.

830
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:51,040
The medicine doesn't help?

831
00:33:51,040 --> 00:33:52,680
Nothing I can do. It's just how I am.

832
00:33:55,600 --> 00:33:56,960
Such a beautiful view.

833
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,680
I'll lie down for a bit.

834
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:02,040
I don't feel well.

835
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:03,520
I'm tired and dizzy.

836
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:04,640
I have a small fan.

837
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:05,520
Let me cool you down.

838
00:34:05,780 --> 00:34:06,800
It's okay.

839
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:07,360
I'll put it here for you.

840
00:34:07,360 --> 00:34:08,680
I don't want to trouble you.

841
00:34:09,660 --> 00:34:10,500
I bought it especially for you.

842
00:34:10,500 --> 00:34:11,480
How is that trouble?

843
00:34:15,040 --> 00:34:16,640
That really hit home.

844
00:34:18,200 --> 00:34:19,040
Thank you.

845
00:34:19,040 --> 00:34:20,040
Does it feel cooler?

846
00:34:20,040 --> 00:34:21,000
Two fans.

847
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:23,080
Okay.

848
00:34:23,080 --> 00:34:24,120
Thanks.

849
00:34:40,600 --> 00:34:42,040
Are you okay?

850
00:34:44,160 --> 00:34:45,560
She said she wants to rest for a while.

851
00:34:46,560 --> 00:34:47,480
Okay.

852
00:34:58,100 --> 00:35:00,220
(Picks it up)

853
00:35:07,160 --> 00:35:08,480
So, should I sleep or not?

854
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:09,200
You are sleeping?

855
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,160
Are you going to sleep?

856
00:35:11,680 --> 00:35:12,920
I mean, if you feel faint,

857
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:14,000
would this not help?

858
00:35:15,560 --> 00:35:17,400
(Takes it)
Let me fan her for a bit.

859
00:35:28,680 --> 00:35:30,120
I will lie down over there for a bit.

860
00:35:30,120 --> 00:35:31,080
All right.

861
00:35:31,080 --> 00:35:32,000
It is comfortable there.

862
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:33,000
Get some rest.

863
00:35:36,540 --> 00:35:38,300
(Adjusts the fan)

864
00:35:38,320 --> 00:35:39,280
Thoughtful.

865
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,680
Take a look at my bangs.

866
00:36:38,680 --> 00:36:40,200
How do my bangs look?

867
00:36:41,280 --> 00:36:42,080
They look nice.

868
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:43,800
(Cui Kaiyi)

869
00:36:43,800 --> 00:36:45,400
What is so nice about them?
They are everywhere.

870
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:46,360
They look natural.

871
00:36:46,360 --> 00:36:47,800
Just like in my dreams.

872
00:36:48,640 --> 00:36:50,520
I dream about you a lot.

873
00:36:51,160 --> 00:36:52,640
What do you mean, "in your dreams"?

874
00:36:53,000 --> 00:36:53,960
I mean...

875
00:36:55,120 --> 00:36:56,760
It feels like a dream.

876
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:14,960
We are almost there, right?

877
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:15,960
Look, we are almost there.

878
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:18,440
Yes, we are almost there.

879
00:37:20,960 --> 00:37:21,560
