each other.

891
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:45,480
We are hugging.

892
00:37:45,920 --> 00:37:46,960
You are getting closer.

893
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:49,560
Yes.

894
00:37:49,560 --> 00:37:51,320
We are still a little cautious, though.

895
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:52,700
(Reluctant to make contact)

896
00:37:53,490 --> 00:37:54,000
Yes, my...

897
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:55,680
