898
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:57,720
We are being cautious too.

899
00:37:57,720 --> 00:37:59,000
Look at my clothes.

900
00:37:59,000 --> 00:37:59,640
What happened?

901
00:38:00,280 --> 00:38:00,640
It got...

902
00:38:00,640 --> 00:38:01,000
Poked by...

903
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:02,080
Poked by this.

904
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:06,040
We are here.

905
00:38:06,040 --> 00:38:07,520
We have arrived.

906
00:38:07,520 --> 00:38:08,280
Let's go.

907
00:38:10,120 --> 00:38:11,880
Come over here and look. There are fish.

908
00:38:12,720 --> 00:38:14,520
They are beautiful.

909
00:38:14,520 --> 00:38:15,760
There are so many sea urchins here.

910
00:38:16,080 --> 00:38:17,120
I see them.

911
00:38:17,120 --> 00:38:19,480
I guess diving is all
about seeing little fish like these.

912
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:20,320
Probably.

913
00:38:20,320 --> 00:38:20,960
Wow.

914
00:38:20,960 --> 00:38:22,280
The water is so clear here.

915
00:38:22,560 --> 00:38:23,120
So many fish.

916
00:38:23,120 --> 00:38:23,960
Colorful fish.

917
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:25,120
Let's go.

918
00:38:25,120 --> 00:38:26,600
We made it to the island without a hitch.

919
00:38:27,200 --> 00:38:28,240
What is this?

920
00:38:28,240 --> 00:38:29,000
What?

921
00:38:29,440 --> 00:38:30,400
This is huge.

922
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:31,360
It really is.

923
