932
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:44,080
One, two, three, four.

933
00:38:44,080 --> 00:38:44,920
Then we will sit here.

934
00:38:52,720 --> 00:38:53,800
I will sit across from you.

935
00:38:54,720 --> 00:38:55,800
Who wants some tea?

936
00:38:56,320 --> 00:38:57,520
I do.

937
00:38:59,360 --> 00:38:59,800
Thank you.

938
00:39:00,200 --> 00:39:00,920
Would you like some?

939
00:39:01,240 --> 00:39:01,960
Yes, thank you.

940
00:39:06,080 --> 00:39:07,160
This too?

941
00:39:07,160 --> 00:39:07,960
Hurry and eat.

942
00:39:07,960 --> 00:39:09,520
