946
00:39:17,720 --> 00:39:19,040
These shrimp are delicious.

947
00:39:20,880 --> 00:39:21,640
Sleepy?

948
00:39:22,160 --> 00:39:23,280
Sleepy.

949
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:24,280
Are you not tired?

950
00:39:24,680 --> 00:39:25,640
I am fine.

951
00:39:26,240 --> 00:39:28,510
Didn't I fall asleep
on the boat earlier?

952
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:34,560
Why not get some sleep first?

953
00:39:34,560 --> 00:39:35,520
