959
00:39:52,320 --> 00:39:53,640
This bag is getting more and more...

960
00:39:53,640 --> 00:39:54,480
Let's go.

961
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:55,440
Where would you like to go?

962
00:39:57,040 --> 00:39:58,560
