976
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:21,320
and enjoy the view.

977
00:40:21,320 --> 00:40:22,760
He is actually looking at Sha Yue'er.

978
00:40:23,720 --> 00:40:24,390
Delicious.

979
00:40:24,390 --> 00:40:24,910
Oh, my goodness.

980
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:28,240
I am going for a walk.

981
00:40:28,240 --> 00:40:30,190
Bye.

982
00:40:40,080 --> 00:40:41,080
This swimsuit,

983
00:40:41,080 --> 00:40:42,400
