984
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:44,400
If you like them, get them.

985
00:40:45,120 --> 00:40:46,320
Let me take a look.

986
00:40:46,960 --> 00:40:48,360
That bag looks nice too.

987
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:49,120
This one?

988
00:40:49,120 --> 00:40:50,520
I want another pair of shorts.

989
00:40:50,520 --> 00:40:51,520
Sure. We can get the bag too.

990
00:40:51,520 --> 00:40:52,160
CEO vibe.

991
00:40:52,160 --> 00:40:53,440
How much is it all?

992
00:40:53,440 --> 00:40:54,160
I will pay.

993
00:40:54,160 --> 00:40:55,040
This is really nice.

994
00:40:55,040 --> 00:40:55,760
Very nice.

995
00:40:55,760 --> 00:40:56,600
Thank you.

996
00:40:57,000 --> 00:40:58,240
Do you have a shopping bag?

997
00:40:58,240 --> 00:40:59,680
Or could you put them in our bag?

998
00:41:01,120 --> 00:41:01,920
Where did everyone go?

999
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:04,240
Everyone is off in different directions.

1000
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:06,640
Let's take the speedboat.

1001
00:41:06,640 --> 00:41:07,200
Let's go.

1002
00:41:07,600 --> 00:41:08,320
Let's set off.

1003
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:11,160
Come on. I will take you over there.

1004
00:41:11,640 --> 00:41:12,160
All right.

1005
00:41:12,700 --> 00:41:14,660
(Holds hands)

1006
00:41:17,800 --> 00:41:20,120
Which one do I use to steer it?

1007
00:41:22,280 --> 00:41:24,960
Then let's head toward the sunset.

1008
00:41:24,960 --> 00:41:25,720
All right.

1009
00:41:27,840 --> 00:41:29,080
I am counting on you, Cui Kaiyi.

1010
00:41:29,080 --> 00:41:29,840
Of course.

1011
00:41:30,060 --> 00:41:31,820
(Gradually veering off course)

1012
00:41:31,900 --> 00:41:33,440
(Under the safety officer's supervision)

1013
00:41:33,440 --> 00:41:35,020
(Heading toward the sunset)
Oh, no.

1014
00:41:35,020 --> 00:41:36,300
(Heading in the opposite direction)
We are turning back.

1015
00:41:37,040 --> 00:41:38,170
(First-time driver)
What?

1016
00:41:38,200 --> 00:41:39,400
It is fine. Turn the wheel right.

1017
00:41:39,640 --> 00:41:40,280
To the right?

1018
00:41:40,280 --> 00:41:40,680
Yes.

1019
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:41,300
(Follows instructions)

1020
00:41:42,260 --> 00:41:43,620
