All right, straighten it out.

1021
00:41:43,840 --> 00:41:44,560
(Instructor)
Now turn left.

1022
00:41:44,760 --> 00:41:45,400
(Got it)
All right.

1023
00:41:47,080 --> 00:41:47,800
Turn left again.

1024
00:41:49,200 --> 00:41:50,040
Okay, straighten it out.

1025
00:41:50,200 --> 00:41:51,160
Straighten it out.

1026
00:41:51,160 --> 00:41:52,420
(Flustered)

1027
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:53,920
Turn left.

1028
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:54,480
You went too far.

1029
00:41:54,480 --> 00:41:55,620
(Spinning in place)

1030
00:41:55,620 --> 00:41:59,090
(Under the safety officer's supervision)

1031
00:41:59,120 --> 00:42:00,800
We are drifting!

1032
00:42:01,140 --> 00:42:03,660
(Back on course)

1033
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:05,600
It is actually just like driving school.

1034
00:42:07,640 --> 00:42:08,360
Is it fun?

1035
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:09,360
It is.

1036
00:42:11,840 --> 00:42:12,360
It is fine.

1037
00:42:12,360 --> 00:42:13,080
(Steadies her)

1038
00:42:13,080 --> 00:42:14,200
It is fine. Do not panic.

1039
00:42:14,200 --> 00:42:15,040
It will not capsize.

1040
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:15,640
Okay.

1041
00:42:15,640 --> 00:42:16,640
Turn left slowly.

1042
00:42:16,640 --> 00:42:17,200
Okay.

1043
00:42:17,760 --> 00:42:18,880
You are braver than me.

1044
00:42:21,080 --> 00:42:23,840
He pays attention to everything I do.

1045
00:42:23,840 --> 00:42:24,840
I am very happy about that.

1046
00:42:25,720 --> 00:42:28,160
Since it was her first time at the wheel,

1047
00:42:28,480 --> 00:42:29,720
