1048
00:42:29,720 --> 00:42:33,000
I have been teaching her
how to turn while holding

1049
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:33,720
onto the wheel.

1050
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:34,880
Through that,

1051
00:42:34,880 --> 00:42:36,640
I realized there were many things

1052
00:42:37,080 --> 00:42:38,080
she needed me to take care of,

1053
00:42:38,080 --> 00:42:39,040
and ways she relied on me.

1054
00:42:40,360 --> 00:42:41,240
Whenever her foot hurts,

1055
00:42:41,240 --> 00:42:42,920
she holds onto me tightly.

1056
00:42:43,280 --> 00:42:45,520
Whenever she wants water,
she comes to me.

1057
00:42:45,840 --> 00:42:47,760
I think she just instinctively

1058
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:48,640
relies on me.

1059
00:42:48,640 --> 00:42:50,400
So I want to do better.

1060
00:42:50,500 --> 00:42:52,220
(I want to do better)

1061
00:42:52,400 --> 00:42:53,000
I cannot think

1062
00:42:53,000 --> 00:42:54,360
of anything else he needs to improve.

1063
00:42:55,080 --> 00:42:56,640
Cao Yiheng is perfect every day.

1064
00:42:56,640 --> 00:42:58,260
(Cao Yiheng is perfect every day)

1065
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:02,680
They want to feel needed by each other.

1066
00:43:02,680 --> 00:43:04,160
To understand each other better.

1067
00:43:05,060 --> 00:43:07,100
(Reaches out)

1068
00:43:09,620 --> 00:43:11,100
(Takes her hand)

1069
00:43:11,720 --> 00:43:12,240
Is this okay?

1070
00:43:12,240 --> 00:43:13,160
Yes.

1071
00:43:13,720 --> 00:43:14,600
This is so much fun.

1072
00:43:14,600 --> 00:43:15,340
(Sneaks a glance)

1073
00:43:16,640 --> 00:43:17,680
Today is absolutely beautiful.

1074
00:43:17,680 --> 00:43:19,600
I feel like I will remember this
for a long time.

1075
00:43:21,960 --> 00:43:22,640
What is it?

1076
00:43:25,440 --> 00:43:27,000
I was captivated by you.

1077
00:43:29,800 --> 00:43:30,600
I think

1078
00:43:30,600 --> 00:43:32,120
we are really in sync.

1079
00:43:32,320 --> 00:43:34,280
I always feel comfortable with him.

1080
00:43:34,640 --> 00:43:36,840
Every day, I discover something
different about him.

1081
00:43:38,120 --> 00:43:38,920
Do you think

1082
00:43:39,880 --> 00:43:41,280
this time feels different

1083
00:43:41,280 --> 00:43:43,080
from our last time rowing together?

1084
00:43:44,920 --> 00:43:46,040
Our relationship has changed.

1085
00:43:46,180 --> 00:43:48,140
(Their first boat ride as a couple)

1086
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:52,980
(Working together to steer our boat)
We are going to see more of the world.

1087
00:43:52,980 --> 00:43:54,270
(We are going to see more of the world)
Yes.

1088
00:43:54,280 --> 00:43:55,520
The view is so peaceful.

1089
00:44:00,760 --> 00:44:02,240
These two are quite amusing.

1090
00:44:02,240 --> 00:44:03,160
Yes.

1091
00:44:03,160 --> 00:44:04,200
They remind me of them.

1092
00:44:08,000 --> 00:44:09,600
Where is our coconut?

1093
00:44:09,600 --> 00:44:10,880
The coconut ice cream.

1094
00:44:12,240 --> 00:44:13,520
Ice cream?

1095
00:44:14,480 --> 00:44:15,760
My period is over.

1096
00:44:17,920 --> 00:44:18,800
I am going to have some.

1097
00:44:19,200 --> 00:44:19,760
All right.

1098
00:44:22,440 --> 00:44:23,520
I think my foot is better.

1099
00:44:23,760 --> 00:44:24,600
Should I get in the water?

1100
00:44:25,960 --> 00:44:26,440
Really.

1101
00:44:26,440 --> 00:44:27,400
(Shakes his head)

1102
00:44:27,400 --> 00:44:28,280
But it does not hurt.

1103
00:44:28,280 --> 00:44:29,800
Even if it has scabbed over,

1104
00:44:29,800 --> 00:44:31,240
the scab is still fragile.

1105
00:44:31,240 --> 00:44:32,240
I'll just soak in the water.

1106
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:33,840
Getting it wet could reopen the wound.

1107
00:44:34,440 --> 00:44:35,480
It is really fine.

1108
00:44:36,240 --> 00:44:37,040
It is really fine.

1109
00:44:37,800 --> 00:44:38,200
All right.

1110
00:44:42,920 --> 00:44:43,880
What else can I say?

1111
00:44:44,840 --> 00:44:45,720
Tell me to keep going.

1112
00:44:45,720 --> 00:44:46,450
How cute.

1113
00:44:51,640 --> 00:44:52,440
Let's change.

1114
00:44:55,400 --> 00:44:55,800
Come on.

1115
00:44:56,320 --> 00:44:56,800
All right.

1116
00:45:00,280 --> 00:45:01,520
What happened? Do you have a wound?

1117
00:45:01,520 --> 00:45:02,760
Yes. She has a small wound.

1118
00:45:02,760 --> 00:45:04,120
But I still really want to play.

1119
00:45:05,020 --> 00:45:06,460
(Turns around)

1120
00:45:07,560 --> 00:45:08,560
Are you looking for something?

1121
00:45:09,020 --> 00:45:11,300
(Takes out a waterproof bandage
prepared in advance)

1122
00:45:12,640 --> 00:45:13,120
All right.

1123
00:45:16,100 --> 00:45:17,940
(Puts on a waterproof bandage)
Wow.

1124
00:45:19,520 --> 00:45:21,080
He is just like a parent.

1125
00:45:21,520 --> 00:45:23,920
I have been going through a sensitive

1126
00:45:24,360 --> 00:45:25,320
period recently,

1127
00:45:25,320 --> 00:45:26,860
(Foot injury)
and now I am injured, too.

1128
00:45:26,920 --> 00:45:28,600
Yu Yang has been very concerned about me.

1129
00:45:28,600 --> 00:45:30,920
He is worried that I might hurt myself

1130
00:45:30,920 --> 00:45:32,200
or get my foot wet.

1131
00:45:32,200 --> 00:45:33,840
(The "parental" boyfriend routine)
I think my foot is good to go in.

1132
00:45:34,080 --> 00:45:35,080
(Request denied)
Be cautious.

1133
00:45:35,080 --> 00:45:36,320
I really feel like my foot is better.

1134
00:45:37,640 --> 00:45:39,360
(Request denied again)
I think you should give it another day

1135
00:45:39,360 --> 00:45:40,080
or two to recover.

1136
00:45:40,800 --> 00:45:41,600
All right.

1137
00:45:41,880 --> 00:45:42,800
I think my foot can go

1138
00:45:42,800 --> 00:45:43,480
in the water today.

1139
00:45:44,060 --> 00:45:46,100
(Looking forward to it)

1140
00:45:48,720 --> 00:45:49,400
Fine. I'll stay out.

1141
00:45:49,460 --> 00:45:50,840
(Request withdrawn)

1142
00:45:50,840 --> 00:45:51,480
Understood.

1143
00:45:52,720 --> 00:45:53,360
I will say nothing.

1144
00:45:54,840 --> 00:45:55,840
Very authoritative.

1145
00:45:56,520 --> 00:45:57,280
Very authoritative.

1146
00:45:57,680 --> 00:45:58,240
His girlfriend

1147
00:45:58,240 --> 00:45:59,040
is quite mischievous.

1148
00:45:59,180 --> 00:45:59,800
Hahaha.

1149
00:45:59,800 --> 00:46:00,440
Right?

1150
00:46:02,160 --> 00:46:04,000
I'm kind of a rebel at heart.

1151
00:46:04,000 --> 00:46:05,400
I can get pretty impulsive.

1152
00:46:05,400 --> 00:46:06,960
Once I set my mind on something,

1153
00:46:06,960 --> 00:46:08,680
I have to do it.

1154
00:46:08,680 --> 00:46:09,400
But luckily,

1155
00:46:09,400 --> 00:46:10,800
I have someone sensible
to keep me grounded.

1156
00:46:11,000 --> 00:46:12,280
I think that's pretty nice.

1157
00:46:16,320 --> 00:46:17,200
What's that sound?

1158
00:46:17,600 --> 00:46:18,240
A songbird.

1159
00:46:18,520 --> 00:46:19,920
There's the whistle.

1160
00:46:19,920 --> 00:46:21,880
That was actually Yu Yang.

1161
00:46:23,080 --> 00:46:24,440
It was Yu Yang's voice.

1162
00:46:24,440 --> 00:46:26,280
You all got it wrong.

1163
00:46:26,280 --> 00:46:27,480
It was Yu Yang.

1164
00:46:27,600 --> 00:46:28,920
(Falls for it)
Really?

1165
00:46:28,920 --> 00:46:30,320
(Just kidding)
No.

1166
00:46:32,400 --> 00:46:34,080
Yu Yang said that was actually my flute.

1167
00:46:41,920 --> 00:46:43,000
How was it? Fun?

1168
00:46:43,000 --> 00:46:43,880
That was such a thrill.

1169
00:46:45,360 --> 00:46:46,280
Is your foot okay?

1170
00:46:46,280 --> 00:46:46,760
Yeah.

1171
00:46:47,560 --> 00:46:48,560
Hold on to me.

1172
00:46:52,000 --> 00:46:52,760
Are you happy?

1173
00:46:52,760 --> 00:46:53,920
It's so beautiful.

1174
00:46:53,920 --> 00:46:55,280
Are you having fun?

1175
00:46:55,280 --> 00:46:57,280
We have this whole sunset

1176
00:46:57,280 --> 00:46:58,120
