1177
00:46:58,120 --> 00:46:58,720
Yeah.

1178
00:46:59,120 --> 00:47:00,680
I love riding jet skis.

1179
00:47:00,880 --> 00:47:01,600
It's such a rush.

1180
00:47:01,600 --> 00:47:02,600
You feel completely free.

1181
00:47:03,600 --> 00:47:04,640
Here's a kiss for you.

1182
00:47:09,760 --> 00:47:11,280
Isn't it salty?

1183
00:47:11,280 --> 00:47:12,800
