1184
00:47:12,800 --> 00:47:13,820
It's actually really sweet.

1185
00:47:13,820 --> 00:47:15,480
Whenever I lick my lips by the sea,

1186
00:47:15,480 --> 00:47:16,600
they taste salty.

1187
00:47:18,520 --> 00:47:19,280
Really salty.

1188
00:47:22,200 --> 00:47:23,360
Here's another kiss.

1189
00:47:24,880 --> 00:47:25,720
You're something else.

1190
00:47:26,640 --> 00:47:27,560
So sweet.

1191
00:47:27,560 --> 00:47:29,400
That's the taste of falling in love.

1192
00:47:29,400 --> 00:47:30,480
My heart definitely skipped a beat.

1193
00:47:33,080 --> 00:47:35,360
The sunset, her, and me.

1194
00:47:35,880 --> 00:47:37,240
It's like a painting.

1195
00:47:38,040 --> 00:47:40,160
(The sunset, her, and me)
And we're right there in it.

1196
00:47:40,880 --> 00:47:41,520
That's so romantic.

1197
00:47:50,000 --> 00:47:51,520
Can we ride these ourselves?

1198
00:47:51,520 --> 00:47:52,380
Yeah, you can.

1199
