1204
00:48:18,440 --> 00:48:19,800
No.

1205
00:48:29,200 --> 00:48:30,940
(Safe landing)
Drive safe. Be careful.

1206
00:48:33,400 --> 00:48:34,440
You go first.

1207
00:48:34,440 --> 00:48:35,480
Sorry.

1208
00:48:38,200 --> 00:48:39,120
As for how I feel,

1209
00:48:39,120 --> 00:48:40,680
