1293
00:52:48,120 --> 00:52:48,480
Yeah.

1294
00:52:48,480 --> 00:52:49,560
Okay, thanks.

1295
00:52:51,720 --> 00:52:53,040
Thanks.

1296
00:52:53,920 --> 00:52:55,000
Should we go line up

1297
00:52:55,000 --> 00:52:55,960
