Chen Hewen, put your hand up.

1304
00:53:13,560 --> 00:53:14,200
Are you brave enough?

1305
00:53:14,800 --> 00:53:15,440
Are you brave enough?

1306
00:53:15,600 --> 00:53:16,160
No, I'm scared.

1307
00:53:20,400 --> 00:53:21,360
Come on, Chen Hewen.

1308
00:53:22,000 --> 00:53:23,320
Haven't you been bungee jumping?

1309
00:53:24,960 --> 00:53:25,600
Yeah, I have.

1310
00:53:26,080 --> 00:53:27,440
But that's over in a second.

1311
