What about you, Liang Xiaoyu?
Would you do it?

1314
00:53:33,860 --> 00:53:34,460
(Liang Xiaoyu)

1315
00:53:34,480 --> 00:53:35,320
Me?

1316
00:53:35,320 --> 00:53:35,960
I can.

1317
00:53:35,960 --> 00:53:36,760
I can do it.

1318
00:53:40,960 --> 00:53:42,240
I can go.

1319
00:53:42,240 --> 00:53:42,680
I'm up for it.

1320
00:53:44,880 --> 00:53:46,080
Let's play rock-paper-scissors.

1321
00:53:46,080 --> 00:53:47,360
The winner goes with Liang Xiaoyu first.

1322
00:53:47,640 --> 00:53:49,080
Rock, paper, scissors.

1323
00:53:49,140 --> 00:53:50,620
(Zhao Xilun wins)

1324
00:53:51,640 --> 00:53:52,680
I won. I'll go first.

1325
00:53:52,920 --> 00:53:53,680
Come on, let's go.

1326
00:53:53,680 --> 00:53:54,760
Okay, you two go.

1327
00:53:56,280 --> 00:53:57,240
I'm actually a little scared too.

1328
00:53:57,760 --> 00:53:59,880
You could switch...

1329
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:01,360
But we're already here.

1330
00:54:01,560 --> 00:54:02,760
Our two brave souls.

1331
00:54:02,760 --> 00:54:03,200
Let's go.

1332
00:54:05,720 --> 00:54:06,680
Anything you want to try, Sha Yue'er?

1333
00:54:06,920 --> 00:54:07,880
I'm fine with anything.

1334
00:54:08,160 --> 00:54:09,360
We could go boating together.

1335
00:54:09,360 --> 00:54:09,920
Sure.

1336
