1343
00:54:25,240 --> 00:54:26,120
It's okay. Just sit back.

1344
00:54:26,120 --> 00:54:26,640
I'll paddle.

1345
00:54:26,960 --> 00:54:27,400
Okay.

1346
00:54:28,760 --> 00:54:30,160
I've figured out how to steer it.

1347
00:54:31,160 --> 00:54:32,320
Wow, you're good.

1348
00:54:32,840 --> 00:54:34,160
You're a quick learner, Mr. Chen.

1349
00:54:34,340 --> 00:54:36,620
(Praises him)

1350
00:54:39,640 --> 00:54:40,400
This is so relaxing.

1351
00:54:40,720 --> 00:54:42,040
Can we just drift for a while?

1352
00:54:43,880 --> 00:54:44,480
Okay, I'll stop paddling.

1353
00:54:44,480 --> 00:54:45,360
(Puts the paddle down immediately)

1354
00:54:45,360 --> 00:54:46,360
Let's just drift.

1355
00:54:48,600 --> 00:54:49,360
It's beautiful.

1356
00:54:50,160 --> 00:54:51,280
He must be loving this.

1357
00:54:54,540 --> 00:54:55,480
We didn't get to go boating
at the house,

1358
00:54:55,480 --> 00:54:56,240
but we finally did here.

1359
00:54:57,720 --> 00:55:00,640
(Open House Day)
What I want to do most next is...

1360
00:55:00,840 --> 00:55:01,880
go boating

1361
00:55:01,880 --> 00:55:04,200
