1362
00:55:07,880 --> 00:55:09,320
What a moment.

1363
00:55:09,320 --> 00:55:10,400
They finally got to do it.

1364
00:55:10,400 --> 00:55:10,960
He was also

1365
00:55:10,960 --> 00:55:12,640
indirectly telling her
that she was the one

1366
00:55:12,640 --> 00:55:14,400
he wanted to go boating with.

1367
00:55:15,390 --> 00:55:16,240
We didn't get to do it at the house,

1368
00:55:16,240 --> 00:55:16,960
but we finally did here.

1369
00:55:16,960 --> 00:55:17,680
We finally did.

1370
00:55:19,600 --> 00:55:20,680
I finally got my boat ride.

1371
00:55:20,680 --> 00:55:21,200
Feels great.

1372
00:55:23,000 --> 00:55:24,200
Finally.

1373
00:55:24,400 --> 00:55:25,320
I'm so happy.

1374
00:55:25,320 --> 00:55:27,080
Yeah, and we're out on the ocean.

1375
00:55:27,080 --> 00:55:27,520
Yeah.

1376
00:55:30,000 --> 00:55:31,160
