1379
00:55:34,840 --> 00:55:36,840
We'll fall right into the sea urchins.

1380
00:55:39,120 --> 00:55:39,880
This is so fun.

1381
00:55:42,280 --> 00:55:44,200
Do you regret not going parasailing?

1382
00:55:45,160 --> 00:55:47,000
Do you regret not going parasailing?

1383
00:55:47,000 --> 00:55:48,220
(Asks)

1384
00:55:48,680 --> 00:55:49,280
Not really.

1385
00:55:49,280 --> 00:55:50,640
We can probably still go later, right?

1386
00:55:51,760 --> 00:55:52,880
That's not what I meant.

1387
00:55:54,120 --> 00:55:55,480
(I'm getting anxious for you)
You little dummy.

1388
00:55:55,480 --> 00:55:56,320
Take that back.

1389
00:56:02,800 --> 00:56:04,560
Where are they parasailing?

1390
00:56:05,400 --> 00:56:06,400
