1391
00:56:07,960 --> 00:56:09,320
Want to give it a try?

1392
00:56:09,320 --> 00:56:10,560
I think I'll pass.

1393
00:56:12,500 --> 00:56:14,660
(Watches)

1394
00:56:16,140 --> 00:56:17,220
(Chen Hewen, Sha Yue'er,
Zhao Xilun, Liang Xiaoyu)

1395
00:56:17,240 --> 00:56:18,440
They can see each other.

1396
00:56:18,720 --> 00:56:19,400
There's a fish!

1397
00:56:19,400 --> 00:56:19,680
Whoa!

1398
00:56:19,680 --> 00:56:20,680
That's a huge fish.

1399
00:56:26,440 --> 00:56:28,440
We're getting farther and farther away.

1400
00:56:32,600 --> 00:56:34,160
If I were here alone today,

1401
00:56:34,160 --> 00:56:35,320
I'd be really scared.

1402
00:56:36,440 --> 00:56:36,840
Yeah.

1403
00:56:38,520 --> 00:56:40,180
(Encourages her)
Have a little faith in yourself.

1404
00:56:43,440 --> 00:56:44,440
We can do this.

1405
00:56:44,920 --> 00:56:45,960
We've got this.

1406
00:56:45,960 --> 00:56:46,880
Cheering each other on.

1407
00:56:46,880 --> 00:56:47,480
I'll go first.

1408
00:56:47,480 --> 00:56:48,880
I can do it. We've got this.

1409
00:56:49,680 --> 00:56:50,900
(Fist bump)
I'll go first.

1410
00:56:53,440 --> 00:56:54,080
Let's go!

1411
00:56:54,920 --> 00:56:56,200
You got this!

1412
00:56:56,440 --> 00:56:56,960
Okay.

1413
00:56:58,160 --> 00:56:58,640
Oh my gosh!

1414
00:56:58,640 --> 00:56:59,440
Oh my gosh.

1415
00:56:59,960 --> 00:57:01,000
Be careful. Stay safe.

1416
00:57:01,000 --> 00:57:01,760
Stay safe.

1417
00:57:01,960 --> 00:57:02,840
No!

1418
00:57:03,280 --> 00:57:05,720
Let's go!

1419
00:57:08,960 --> 00:57:10,680
That looks so fun.

1420
00:57:15,840 --> 00:57:16,720
Let's go.

1421
00:57:18,880 --> 00:57:21,160
I'm flying.

1422
00:57:23,240 --> 00:57:24,880
Liang Xiaoyu and I were really relaxed.

1423
00:57:24,880 --> 00:57:28,160
Out there on the ocean,
we just kept cheering each other on.

1424
00:57:29,360 --> 00:57:32,920
I'm flying.

1425
00:57:32,920 --> 00:57:34,320
It was so much fun
once we were up in the air.

1426
00:57:34,320 --> 00:57:35,600
I felt so cool

1427
00:57:35,600 --> 00:57:37,120
